 "strings": {
  "But it's more than that.": "",
  "But that's not true.": "",
  "Kamurocho... It's a city of dreams. Where even\nfrom the gutters, you can shoot for the stars.": "",
  "This city is where people go when they hit\nrock bottom, to try clawing their way back up.": "",
  "So if you wanna get ahead\nin this town...": "",
  "If that's of interest to you...": "",
  "Well, kid.\nI'll teach you everything I know.": "",
  "I'll teach you everything\nyou'll need to know.": "",
  "But look...": "",
  "Starting with this...": "",
  "If nothing else, you might wanna lay off\nyour little date nights with Kaito.": "",
  "Stop picking fights with Kaito\nthat you can't win.": "",
  "Everyone ready?": "",
  "Here we go!": "",
  "Going in...!": "",
  "Alright, place your bets!": "",
  "Place your bets!": "",
  "C'mon! Last call!\nAll right, I got one over here.": "",
  "Come on, call 'em!": "",
  "Anyone taking even?\nI got an even!": "",
  "Even? Anyone for even?": "",
  "C'mon, c'mon, let's go!": "",
  "Go already. Hurry up.": "",
  "Next round, let's go!": "",
  "Kaito-san!　": "",
  "Bets down!": "",
  "The bets are in.": "",
  "Alright! Let's go!": "",
  "Come on, come on!": "",
  "Show it!": "",
  "Moment of truth!": "",
  "Yes! There we go!": "",
  "Yeah, there we go!　": "",
  "Oh, I'm on fucking fire tonight!": "",
  "Finally getting my groove back!　": "",
  "Hell yeah, Captain!": "",
  "Good call, Captain!": "",
  "We're just getting started!": "",
  "Keep 'em coming!": "",
  "Watch your fucking feet!": "",
  "Watch where you're walking!": "",
  "You fucking serious?\nGet the fuck out of here!": "",
  "C'mon, asshole!": "",
  "Such a small world, isn't it?": "",
  "It's been a while, Captain.": "",
  "You're not exactly\nan easy man to find.": "",
  "It wasn't easy finding you.　": "",
  "Shit.": "",
  "Shit...!": "",
  "Go!": "",
  "Again, huh. Ready Tak?": "",
  "Let's do it, Tak!": "",
  "You done yet?": "",
  "Are you done?": "",
  "Or do you want me\nto keep hitting you?": "",
  "We can keep fighting if you want.": "",
  "Oh fuck you!": "",
  "Fuck you...!": "",
  "You hired the thief that stole\nthe money from the office that day. ": "",
  "The thief that stole the\nhundred mil from the family safe...": "",
  "It was all just a setup,\nwasn't it Hamura?": "",
  "That was your doing, wasn't it?": "",
  "What, memory's eludin' ya?": "",
  "You set me up to take the fall?": "",
  "Buuut it's all water under the bridge,\nisn't it. Now that I can do this.": "",
  "Actually, we've got\nmore pressing questions.": "",
  "What about the Mole? Everything he does\nis under your command, huh?": "",
  "The Mole...\nHe's an assassin under your employ, right?": "",
  "How many people has\nthe Mole murdered?": "",
  "How many people has he killed?": "",
  "All those Kyorei guys. Shintani.\nNo way those are the only ones.": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan yakuza, Shintani...\nThe list doesn't end there, does it?": "",
  "Shintani, before he got murdered, was so sure\nthe Mole wasn't part of some yakuza war. ": "",
  "Before Shintani died, he said\nthe Mole's targets weren't yakuza related.": "",
  "He wouldn't have said that\nwithout information to support it.": "",
  "And he probably knew more than that.": "",
  "And so, you had to silence him.\nMade the Mole use Ayabe's gun to hide the trail.": "",
  "Is that why you silenced him?\nYou even got the Mole to use Ayabe's gun.": "",
  "Like hell I did.": "",
  "I wouldn't know...": "",
  "Shintani knew your secret.\nHe knew the Mole murders were linked to the ADDC.": "",
  "Shintani must have found something that\ntied the Kamurocho killings to the ADDC.": "",
  "All this comes right back to AD-9,\ndoesn't it?": "",
  "This has something to do\nwith AD-9, doesn't it!?": "",
  "Shove it up your ass!": "",
  "I told you I don't know!　": "",
  "Now hands off!\nOr I'm gonna fucking kill you!": "",
  "Let go of me, Kaito!\nI'll kill you!": "",
  "You seriously never listen, huh?": "",
  "Just sit tight\nand let Tak do the talking.": "",
  "Hamura.": "",
  "...Hamura.": "",
  "The Center's Director, Kido.": "",
  "Kido from the ADDC...": "",
  "Is he the one who's behind\nall this carnage?": "",
  "He's the real maestro here, right?": "",
  "Is it Kido?": "",
  "Is that not right?": "",
  "Or am I off?": "",
  "Start talking quick, asshole!": "",
  "Why aren't you talking!?": "",
  "Not feelin' it, huh?\nThen how 'bout I kill you right here!": "",
  "Would you rather die right here\nthan answer the question!?": "",
  "Kido's not our guy.": "",
  "So it isn't Kido?": "",
  "And the phone call. When Shintani tried to reach the Center...\nHe wasn't trying to talk to Director Kido at all.": "",
  "When Shintani called the ADDC,\nhe asked for Shono, not Kido.": "",
  "It does seem we received a phone call\nfrom this Shintani-san you speak of.": "",
  "It seems we did receive a phone call\nfrom this Shintani-san fellow.": "",
  "Do you know who he was calling?": "",
  "Do you know who he called?": "",
  "Dr. Shono.": "",
  "Shono.": "",
  "Hashiki, too. He was trying to get information\nout of Shono until someone got to him.": "",
  "Hashiki was trying to get info\nout of Shono until he died, too.": "",
  "So the one I want...": "",
  "Then that means...": "",
  "It's Shono, huh?": "",
  "It's Shono?": "",
  "Right, Hamura?": "",
  "Now I'm right, huh?": "",
  "Hey! Fire! Fire!": "",
  "H-Hey! Fire!": "",
  "Guess someone's got it\nout for us, huh Tak?": "",
  "Shit, someone torched the place!": "",
  "Captain!": "",
  "Let's move!": "",
  "Hamura's gone.": "",
  "Where's Hamura?": "",
  "Well, looks like his shithead\nboys took him outta here.": "",
  "His boys ran him outta here.": "",
  "Holy hell...": "",
  "Holy shit...": "",
  "I'm just glad we're still alive.": "",
  "We're lucky to be alive.": "",
  "I helped set a murderer loose\non the world. In other words...": "",
  "I got a murderer acquitted.\nAnd then...": "",
  "...Emi died because of me.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa paid the price.": "",
  "I'm not gonna let you\ndo this to yourself!": "",
  "Pull your head out of your ass!": "",
  "Do you remember your dad's last case?\nMust have been almost 20 years ago. Do you Yagami?": "",
  "Your father's last trial was\ntwenty years ago now... You remember it?": "",
  "Yeah. No way I could forget.": "",
  "Yeah. I could never forget.": "",
  "The defendant in that case raped and murdered\na 15-year old girl. At least that's what they said he did.": "",
  "Your father defended a monster who\nraped and strangled a fifteen-year-old girl.": "",
  "Everyone in the damn country thought\nthat guy deserved to get executed. ": "",
  "The whole country wanted\nto see the man executed...": "",
  "No thoughts of innocence...\nExcept from your dad.": "",
  "But your father proved him innocent!": "",
  "You know how it all went down after that.\nHe gave the prosecution what for.": "",
  "And after he won that case,\ndo you know what he said?": "",
  "Your dad never compromised\nhis ideals, no matter what.": "",
  "\"It's not the defense's job\nto uncover the truth.\"": "",
  "He said a lawyer's job isn't discovering the truth. Or even knowing it.\nIt's proving the prosecution doesn't have enough evidence to convict.": "",
  "\"It's to challenge the prosecution\nto make an indisputable argument.\"": "",
  "Do you understand?\nThat's how he saw the defense's role.": "",
  "He was proud to be an attorney.": "",
  "Takes some real guts to say that.": "",
  "And he was brave to say that.": "",
  "It's why you looked up to him. And you would've never\nbecome an attorney without his influence.": "",
  "And isn't that strength what led you\nto put on your own attorney's badge?": "",
  "In the beginning...\nSure I did.": "",
  "Yeah, that was the spark.": "",
  "But you know...": "",
  "A lot happened afterward.\nWith my dad... And with me, too.": "",
  "That trial was the catalyst for\na lot of things, and not just me.": "",
  "...Yeah.": "",
  "...Right.": "",
  "It's possible the defendant actually was guilty.\nRaped the girl... killed her in cold blood.": "",
  "The guy my dad defended was\nprobably guilty the whole time.": "",
  "He disappeared almost\nimmediately after the trial.": "",
  "He went off the grid\nas soon as he got acquitted.": "",
  "And so... All of the hatred.\nAll of the anger people felt...": "",
  "So public animosity shifted to\nthe next target in line, his lawyer.": "",
  "...Was thrown onto my dad.": "",
  "And that's when my parents...": "",
  "Not long after... He and my mom were killed.\nBy the victim's father.": "",
  "...Were stabbed to death by\nthe father of the victim.": "",
  "Long time no see...\nYagami-sensei.": "",
  "Long time no see... Yagami-sensei.": "",
  "Yeah... It's been a while.": "",
  "Yeah. Been a while.": "",
  "I apologize.": "",
  "Uh, sorry.　": "",
  "I've been alone... all this time.": "",
  "I don't talk much, so talking is...": "",
  "Talking is...": "",
  "...Hard.": "",
  "Don't worry.\nWe're not in a rush here.": "",
  "It's fine. Take your time.": "",
  "You look... so different.": "",
  "You look... different.": "",
  "I haven't been back in the courtroom\nsince the last day of our case.": "",
  "You were the last guy\nI defended in court.": "",
  "Meaning you're...\nnot a lawyer?": "",
  "You quit?": "",
  "Not quite. I'm a detective.": "",
  "I'm a detective these days.　": "",
  "In Kamurocho.\nIt pays the bills, you know?": "",
  "Based in Kamurocho.\nJust doing odd jobs here and there.": "",
  "And that's all my fault?": "",
  "Because of me?": "",
  "Hey...": "",
  "No.": "",
  "Sorry. This isn't what\nI came here to talk about today.": "",
  "Sorry.\nI should probably get to the point.": "",
  "Three years ago... at the ADDC.": "",
  "Three years ago, at the ADDC...": "",
  "Did you...": "",
  "Our case...": "",
  "Did you actually murder\nWaku-san or not?": "",
  "Did you do it or not?": "",
  "What...?": "",
  "Eh?": "",
  "Yagami, I...": "",
  "I don't understand.": "",
  "That's not even funny.": "",
  "You know I'm innocent.": "",
  "I'm innocent.": "",
  "I didn't murder Waku-san...\nor Emi-chan!": "",
  "The ADDC case and Emi's case too!": "",
  "Why won't you listen to me!?\nI've told you time and time again...": "",
  "I didn't do it!\nI said it over and over!": "",
  "I didn't kill anyone!": "",
  "Weren't you listening!?": "",
  "Why won't people just believe me!?": "",
  "Why doesn't anyone believe me!?": "",
  "Goddammit!": "",
  "Damn it!": "",
  "I don't know what the hell\nI was thinking back then.": "",
  "I don't know what\nwent through my head...": "",
  "It all happened so fast.\nI opened the truck, and the body was there!": "",
  "I wasn't expecting a corpse\nwhen I opened my truck's door!　": "",
  "Naturally, I panicked. The police never would\nhave believed I didn't kill the guy.": "",
  "But I knew the police wouldn't\nbelieve me for a second.": "",
  "Course not.\nWhy would they?": "",
  "A guy with a criminal record?": "",
  "I already had a criminal record, too. ": "",
  "No one was going to\ntake my word for it...": "",
  "I was a fool.": "",
  "I remember thinking that...": "",
  "I guess...　": "",
  "So you really were\ninnocent after all, huh?": "",
  "You really didn't do it, did you?": "",
  "Do you even need to ask?": "",
  "Isn't it obvious?": "",
  "I guess not.": "",
  "Thank you.": ""
 },
